author: claude
estimated_minutes: 600
acceptance_criteria: A generation without both a proxy and a held-out score cannot be promoted; the gap and its per-generation delta are reported by the lineage view; a widening gap over a configurable window is surfaced as a named finding rather than left for a reader to notice; the held-out score is always attributed to the pinned environment version and seed set that produced it
